guide forever/horde/03-hillsbrad
title Undercity & Hillsbrad Foothills
faction Horde
levels 18-22
zone Hillsbrad Foothills
next forever/horde/04-barrens

# A deviation from the simulator's consensus Horde route (world 0ee62c78): the final consensus stays in the Barrens from 11
# to 23.7 and grinds about 4 h there between 19.4 and 23 (Camp Taurajo, the
# Field of Giants, Razorfen Kraul). This guide replaces that grind with a
# Tarren Mill loop, the Undercity / Alterac packages of the earlier consensus
# (Undercity at 18.2, Tarren Mill at 18.4-22.1), every quest of them in the
# simulator's order. Built from the Era-baseline reference data; not yet
# play-tested on Forever. The simulator files Tarren Mill under the Alterac
# Mountains (its map overlaps both zones); in game it is on the Hillsbrad
# Foothills map.
#
# Measured cost (simulator, world 0ee62c78; cumulative hours at the end of
# forever/horde/07-thousand-needles, level 32.1, with this guide against the
# same chain without it): Orc +0.04 h, Tauren +0.15 h, Undead +0.15 h,
# Skyborne +0.03 h (at most 0.6% of the band); 13 quests instead of the
# grind. The band with it is still 2.3-3.6% faster than the consensus for
# every race. forever/horde/30-40/02-alterac builds on The Rescue (498).
#
# Everyone meets here: Orcs, Trolls and Tauren come from the Barrens by the
# Orgrimmar zeppelin, Undead and Skyborne from the Barrens or from Silverpine
# Forest by bat.
#
# Flow: Undercity (Unending Torment, training) -> fly to Tarren Mill (bind) ->
# the hills west of town (bears, creepers, lions) -> Hillsbrad Fields (farmers)
# -> Tarren Mill -> Stanley and the southern fields (peasants, skulls) ->
# Tarren Mill -> the Syndicate camps and Durnholde Keep -> Tarren Mill.
#
# Additions to the earlier consensus visit (measured with the simulator, Orc;
# cumulative hours at the end of 07-thousand-needles): Battle of Hillsbrad's
# second part (528, -0.08 h), Souvenirs of Death (546, -0.02 h), and The
# Rescue / WANTED: Syndicate Personnel, which that visit picked up and never
# finished (498, 549).
#
# Left out:
# - Battle of Hillsbrad from the smithy on (529, 532: +0.11 h) and Dangerous!
#   (567: +0.08 h; Miner Hackett is level 29); the Elixir of Agony chain (509,
#   minimum level 24).
# - Hunters, Shamans and Druids have no trainer in the Undercity or Tarren
#   Mill: they train in Orgrimmar at the start of the next guide.
# - Tauren Druids from the Barrens first fly from the Crossroads to Thunder
#   Bluff to hand Turak Runetotem Power over Poison and Aquatic Form (6130,
#   31, from Dendrite in Moonglade), then fly to Orgrimmar for the zeppelin.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Druids: Thunder Bluff

step Turak Runetotem
  only Tauren,Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip From the Crossroads, where your hearthstone took you from Moonglade, fly to Thunder Bluff. Turak teaches on Elder Rise. Then fly to Orgrimmar and take the zeppelin to the Undercity.
  turnin 6130                         -- Turak Runetotem
  turnin 31

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Undercity

step The Undercity
  zone Undercity
  tip From the Orgrimmar zeppelin: the towers stand outside the Ruins of Lordaeron; the Undercity is below the ruins. From Silverpine: you arrive by bat.
  getfp "Undercity" npc 4551          -- Michael Garrett, the bat handler
  accept 97289                        -- Master Apothecary Faranell, in the Apothecarium
  accept 97291
  accept 97292

step Othmar's body
  zone Undercity
  tip Othmar's body lies on the Unfinished Abomination's table next to the Apothecarium. Inject the Hissing Serum into the system above it, then lay the Baron's head on the body.
  turnin 97289                        -- Unfinished Abomination
  accept 97290

step Faranell's reagents
  zone Undercity
  tip Tawny Grisette sells the Toxic Skullcap in the Trade Quarter; the Blisterweed grows beside Martha Alliestar, the herbalism trainer in the Magic Quarter; any poison vendor in the Rogues' Quarter sells the Essence of Agony.
  buy 281246 npc 4554 x1
  collect 281300 quest 97291.2 @54.0,49.3
  buy 8923 nearest x1

step Master Apothecary Faranell
  zone Undercity
  turnin 97292
  turnin 97290
  turnin 97291
  train class only !Hunter,!Shaman,!Druid
  vendor nearest

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tarren Mill

step Tarren Mill
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  fly "Tarren Mill"
  getfp "Tarren Mill" npc 2389        -- Zarise
  sethome "Tarren Mill" npc 2388      -- Innkeeper Shay
  accept 498                          -- Krusk
  accept 549                          -- The WANTED poster by the inn
  accept 527                          -- High Executor Darthalia
  accept 496                          -- Apothecary Lydon

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West: the hills and Hillsbrad Fields

step Bears and creepers
  tip West of Tarren Mill, Gray Bears and Forest Moss Creepers roam the hills on the way down to the farms. The creepers drop Creeper Ichor rarely; you need only one.
  goto 49.5,31.0 "Hills west of Tarren Mill"
  collect 3476 quest 496.1
  collect 3477 quest 496.2

step Hillsbrad Fields
  tip The farms east of Hillsbrad town. Farmer Ray works the field by the northern farmhouse, Farmer Getz the one further south-east; Farmhands and Farmers are everywhere.
  goto 33.4,38.9 "Hillsbrad Fields"
  kill 2360 quest 527.1
  kill 2266 quest 527.2
  kill 232 quest 527.3
  kill 2403 quest 527.4

step Tarren Mill
  tip Starving Mountain Lions prowl the hills on the way back east; any of them may drop blood for Lydon's next task.
  turnin 496                          -- Apothecary Lydon
  accept 499
  turnin 499                          -- Umpi, next to Lydon
  accept 501
  turnin 527                          -- High Executor Darthalia
  accept 528
  accept 546                          -- Deathguard Samsa

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Lions, peasants and skulls

step Mountain lions
  tip Starving Mountain Lions roam the hills between Tarren Mill and the farms.
  goto 49.1,39.2 "Starving Mountain Lions"
  collect 3496 quest 501.1

step Peasants and skulls
  tip The Peasants work the fields south of the farmhouses. Every Hillsbrad human drops skulls; the Peasants and the smithy's apprentices drop them most often.
  goto 33.4,44.5 "Southern fields"
  kill 2267 quest 528.1
  collect 3692 quest 546.1

step Tarren Mill
  turnin 528                          -- High Executor Darthalia
  turnin 546                          -- Deathguard Samsa
  turnin 501                          -- Apothecary Lydon
  accept 502

step Stanley
  tip Stanley is Farmer Ray's dog, at the northern farmhouse in Hillsbrad Fields. Hearth back afterwards.
  turnin 502

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East: the Syndicate

step Syndicate camps
  tip From Tarren Mill go south-east into the hills on the way to Durnholde Keep. Rogues and Watchmen hold the camps along the way.
  hearth "Tarren Mill"
  goto 76.6,43.6 "Syndicate camps"
  kill 2260 quest 549.1
  kill 2261 quest 549.2

step Durnholde Keep
  tip Drull and Tog'thar are chained inside Durnholde Keep's courtyard buildings; open both locks.
  interact 1721 quest 498.1           -- Drull's ball and chain
  interact 1722 quest 498.2           -- Tog'thar's ball and chain

step Tarren Mill
  turnin 549                          -- High Executor Darthalia
  turnin 498                          -- Krusk
  tip The next guide flies to the Undercity and takes the zeppelin back to Kalimdor.
